# Keep the build context lean and prevent secrets from entering the
# image layer. Only app/, requirements.txt, alembic/ and alembic.ini are
# copied, but the context is still sent to the daemon in full.
#
# `alembic/` and `alembic.ini` MUST NOT be listed here. They were, until
# 2026-09-27, which meant the `migrate` stage could not COPY them: the
# package was installed and the revision scripts were not, so the image
# started, passed its healthcheck, and could not run a migration. A file
# excluded from the build context fails the COPY loudly, but only once
# someone builds the stage.
# Guarded by tests/test_deploy_assets.py.
.git
.gitignore
.env
**/.env
**/venv
venv
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
.pytest_cache
.coverage
htmlcov
tests
docs
openspec
ai-specs
.opencode
.claude_example
openspec_example
infra
etl
scripts
prompts
gtk-companies
packages
core
init.sql
bootstrap.sh
docker-compose.yml
*.md
*.json
*.yml
